<title>USA: U.S. soyoil weekly export sales highlights -- USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. soyoil weekly export sales highlights -- USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA soyoil weekly export sales highlights in latest reporting week:</p>
<p>Sales of 19,500 MT were primarily for Mexico (7,300 MT), Hong Kong (6,000 MT), China (5,000 MT), and Singapore (1,000 MT).  Exports of 9,300 MT were mainly to South Korea (7,000 MT) and Singapore (1,000 MT).</p>
</text>
